   131	## §9 guard
   132	
   133	- "four hundred": the 298th log only (45.4). Karis gives the fifth place no figure for its age; she says only that its series is older than the form's way of counting.
   134	- "Architect": not used. "un-bound": not used. The leaf is called "the leaf" or "the skin"; its face is not quoted; its back is described and not printed.
   135	- No *terminal*, *circuit*, *infrastructure*. Nothing joins the list to lamps, sigils, plates, Arbiters or stations. No instrument attends, notices or wants.
