   200	
   201	He nodded, by the width of a finger, and it was done, and he had not offered his hand. There was a cloth on a nail behind Pike's head with one name alone on its first line and five in a row on its eleventh; and a contract did not take either of them down. Cael found that he did not wish it to. He would sooner walk east beside a man who was ten places better at a thing, and said so, than beside a friend who had to be reminded which of them the ledger preferred.
