    54	- **The Span itself (noon).** An arch on two piers over the sink. Carvings on the piers' inner faces, copied. No steps: the arch is walked as a road rises. The bearing runs "Through". **Nothing happens on the crown.** The thirteenth listens and the ribs know the cost. **The log, verbatim.**
