editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:185:## 5. POV plan
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:194:| **Karis** | ≈7,500 (3) | M1: a cold night [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 6] with the kit's index (her want; the cord reads wrong only for him, and she refuses a theory). M5: decipherment (board numerals; the first letters). M8: the night after the lamps finding (the refusal held in her own head). | The sheets; strata; the index (as unreadable until the 298th); the leaf (after the 293rd); the lamps finding. | The Rune finding (nobody knows it). The integration of Rune before Cael tells Lira. **Drawing the line**: her interior names that the sentence exists and refuses it. The deep-layer date as Cael's Kindling. The leaf's content before it is read aloud. |
