    70	- 45:263 Oryn, "Stand there." (BOOK_MAP §13 quotes the two words).
    71	- 45:343 Oryn, "Who sewed this." — placed on inference: the older healer never speaks to the six.
    72	- 46:81 Oryn, "May I?" and 46:83 Cael, "Yes." Her "May I?" is asked at each reading (45:295, 45:323, 45:337, 45:367).
    73	- 46:197 Oryn's finding (Tier A 25), whole.
    74	- The packet's reductions used once each: *Withdrawn* is mine (41:221); "an arm" (45:331, Oryn; BOOK_MAP §3 B 7).
