+12. **Cael's account of why nothing came — KEEP as his inference** (`chapter-43.md:99–111`).
+13. **Horseman — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:117–171,245`).
+14. **Halting-ground — KEEP after ride references are removed** (`chapter-43.md:137–187`).
