+## 7. Names
+
+No unapproved proper name is minted. Existing names only: Cael, Karis, Brom, Lira, Seln, Vastin, Cleon, Oryn, Teague, Pike, Hesk, Ternhall, Treswick, Lowmarch, Millrace, Fallow, Stair, Hall, Line, Compact and Path-family terms as already canonical.
+
+Unnamed roles on the surviving page: woman of the half-door; woman with tarred hands; rope-walk carter; bead-frame keeper; shoulder-hold factor; horseman; landing broker and clerk; ferryman; salt carter; miller and wife; Teague's tall spear-carrier, bow-carrier, young one, and older healer; brown mule. The draft's net-woman is cut by fix 48. The faction remains faceless, unnamed and unlocated beyond the observed road and landing signs (`chapter-43.md:117–171,245`).
