+## 6. New canon minted
+
+Rulings follow the Author Report's order (`AUTHOR-REPORT.md:82–116`).
+
+1. **Back of leaf — AMEND vocabulary, otherwise KEEP.** Nine lines, noun/count form, fourth-line structure, three sure signs, and no spoken numbers stay (`chapter-41.md:29–65,113–155`). Replace sign-noun *bearer*.
