+
+### Present and correct
+
+- Tier A 11, Cleon's goodbye, is whole, once, and correctly located at the iron door: “Work. Not a finding.” (`chapter-41.md:193`) and “Mind the stair. It leans.” (`41:205`). Cleon is not above ground (`41:213`).
