+## 6. New canon minted
+
+Rulings follow the Author Report's order (`AUTHOR-REPORT.md:82–116`).
+
+1. **Back of leaf — AMEND vocabulary, otherwise KEEP.** Nine lines, noun/count form, fourth-line structure, three sure signs, and no spoken numbers stay (`chapter-41.md:29–65,113–155`). Replace sign-noun *bearer*.
+2. **Cleon's turn/copy/lamp — KEEP** (`chapter-41.md:27–31,71–81,145–151,167–189`).
+3. **Sheet withdrawal and tally — KEEP** (`chapter-41.md:83–99,163–165,217–223`).
+4. **Rope/dray — AMEND.** Keep coil, price, forty coils, saying, carter, and free carriage of the rope; cut Vastin's ride and coppers (`chapter-42.md:13–63`).
+5. **Outer gate — AMEND.** Preserve “Six out / six in,” but count his boots on the road, not the tail-board (`chapter-42.md:65–77`).
+6. **Bridge — KEEP** (`chapter-42.md:79–121`).
+7. **Road-east detail — KEEP after walking repair** (`chapter-42.md:177–271`).
+8. **Cael/Vastin consent perimeter — KEEP** (`chapter-42.md:145–159`).
+9. **Sheep/cart count — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:3–15`).
+10. **Factor offer — AMEND:** cut Vastin's seat; **KEEP** Teague as “he” (`chapter-43.md:19–45`).
+11. **Cut — KEEP after protected speakers are restored** (`chapter-43.md:53–115`).
+12. **Cael's account of why nothing came — KEEP as his inference** (`chapter-43.md:99–111`).
+13. **Horseman — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:117–171,245`).
+14. **Halting-ground — KEEP after ride references are removed** (`chapter-43.md:137–187`).
+15. **Landing/ferry — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:199–245`).
+16. **Lowmarch fires — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:249`).
+17. **Teague window — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:3–97`). It adds no mechanism knowledge.
+18. **Pike — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:101–157`). Arithmetic and blank date are correct.
+19. **Contract heads — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:169–201`). They are required facts and do not duplicate the minimal protected join.
+20. **Meadow cart — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:215–257`).
+21. **File — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:261–307`).
+22. **Grade — AMEND.** Keep the three marks, empty first box, fifth place, distance, and old-last inference; replace annual series with first-sheet ages and repair *bearer* (`chapter-45.md:3–177`). Seln's earlier “I had supposed that it was six years” remains consistent with the six annual rows everyone had seen (`chapter-45.md:99`; closed `chapter-11.md:221–247`).
+23. **South road — AMEND.** Vastin walks; keep the well, file, log-reading, and route (`chapter-45.md:181–231`).
+24. **Millrace — AMEND only the ford-keeper speaker; otherwise KEEP** (`chapter-45.md:235–291`).
+25. **Readings — KEEP after protected restoration** (`chapter-45.md:295–379`).
+26. **Two tellings — KEEP** (`chapter-46.md:3–63`). Oryn also hears the eleventh; the Rune finding remains untold.
+27. **Deep reading — KEEP** (`chapter-46.md:67–205`). The turn is inward, unbidden, *still* then *set*; Oryn's half-notice is permissible.
+28. **After — AMEND.** Keep two-findings comparison, eye-cost, four reasons, and leaning warning; cut Lira's detection and Cael's disclosure (`chapter-46.md:207–289`).
+29. **Dawn — AMEND count speaker; otherwise KEEP** (`chapter-46.md:293–339`).
