+9. **Sheep/cart count — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:3–15`).
+10. **Factor offer — AMEND:** cut Vastin's seat; **KEEP** Teague as “he” (`chapter-43.md:19–45`).
+11. **Cut — KEEP after protected speakers are restored** (`chapter-43.md:53–115`).
+12. **Cael's account of why nothing came — KEEP as his inference** (`chapter-43.md:99–111`).
+13. **Horseman — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:117–171,245`).
+14. **Halting-ground — KEEP after ride references are removed** (`chapter-43.md:137–187`).
+15. **Landing/ferry — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:199–245`).
+16. **Lowmarch fires — KEEP** (`chapter-43.md:249`).
+17. **Teague window — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:3–97`). It adds no mechanism knowledge.
+18. **Pike — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:101–157`). Arithmetic and blank date are correct.
+19. **Contract heads — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:169–201`). They are required facts and do not duplicate the minimal protected join.
+20. **Meadow cart — KEEP** (`chapter-44.md:215–257`).
