+   old: `"It stands four times on that floor, always behind a bearer. I uncovered it on my ninth day under the town, and it was not the word that I had wished for. It was only *set*, as a stone is set, or a stake."`
+   new: `"It stands four times on that floor, always behind a sign that bears. I uncovered it on my ninth day under the town, and it was not the word that I had wished for. It was only *set*, as a stone is set, or a stake."`
