+40. `manuscript/chapter-45.md`
+   old: `"Ninety-four," said Karis. "On the row beneath it, the same place has ninety-three, and then ninety-two; it goes down by one with every row, to eighty-nine. I took it for a drawer's number, and so it is. I never asked what the drawer was counting."`
+   new: `"Ninety-four years by its first sheet," said Karis. "Not by the stone. By the first time the office wrote the place down."`
