+9. `manuscript/chapter-42.md`
+   old: `The keeper looked at her, for the first time. It was plain that nobody argued with that frame from one cold term to the next. Then he moved two beads along the upper wire, slowly, as a man pays a debt that he had hoped was forgotten.`
