+The day spine is correct and in order: 294 (`chapter-41.md:3`), 295 (`chapter-42.md:9`), 296 (`chapter-43.md:5`), 297 (`chapter-43.md:199`), 298 (`chapter-44.md:217`; `chapter-45.md:181–215`), 299 (`chapter-46.md:293`). This matches `BOOK_MAP.md:234–239`.
