+43. `manuscript/chapter-45.md`
+   old: `"Thank you. That is exactly as much as I wanted." Her finger had gone to the hide, and it touched each ring in turn, going east. "The Fallow's newest sheet is its sixty-first, and the Stair's is its ninety-fourth; the hall's is a hundred and thirty-eight. And the place behind the iron—"`
+   new: `"Thank you. That is exactly as much as I wanted." Her finger had gone to the hide, and it touched each ring in turn, going east. "The Ring is sixty-one years from its first sheet, and the Stair ninety-four; the Hall is a hundred and thirty-eight. And the place behind the iron—"`
